  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.AfBox.pi_box | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.AfBox.pi_box | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.AfBox.pi_box <;> assumption)
